[I] Execute code after a scope finished compilation

[T] B::Hooks::EndOfScope runs code at the end of the compilation of the
[T] surrounding lexical scope, as used by namespace::clean to remove
[T] imported functions once a package is compiled.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/B-Hooks-EndOfScope

